      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Mouse is 2D device, and it's more harder to move fast and seamless in 3D. If you use keyboard to change 2D motion to Z, you cannot use XY and writing or draw is still too hard. Rotating hands same reason.\n\nSince WMR headsets are a lot cheaper than Oculus / Rift, why not buy one? Accept the limits of Mouse / Keyboard use, and go save money for WMR as first 3D use.\nAlternative is for example PS Move controllers + 4 cameras. Or Leap Motion controller, or get Kinect One (v2) because it can see your hands. So much alternatives for better 3D motions.\n\nI understand VRChat is social fun, but it's like playing MMO on way too slow pc. Others are waiting for you to enter dungeon for long time, and it's just not great, more annoying.\n\nThink about it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
