  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-29T15:50:24.891Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Simply hold down a button and move your mouse to move your arm around in front of you. For the longest time \"Head pats\" Have been a thing in VRC but it has been sully restricted to Headset users only. Up vote this to push for change.  \n\nDT users are still the majority.",
